{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>And dark hair has grown in it.</b> The vav in place of 'or' — like <b>מכה אביו ואמו</b> and <b>מקלל אביו ואמו</b>, <b>מן הכבשים ומן העזים תקחו</b>; so too here: either the hair has remained standing in it, or black hair has grown in it." "<b>It is pure.</b> Since it has remained standing in it or black hair has grown in it, the flesh has not weakened."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:56.451005147Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}